  "id": "roasted-vegetable-stock",
  "name": "Roasted Vegetable Stock",
  "subtitle": "A rich, savory base from roasted vegetables and herbs",
  "description": "Roast vegetables until tender, then simmer them with water and herbs to make a flavorful stock for soups, grains, sauces, and more.",
